        "claim": "skills_root is stored as an absolute path at install time. If the overlay directory later moves or is removed, every subagent launch is denied with 'skill list could not be checked' or an unknown-id refusal, even for prompts with no skill header, until the install is re-run. There is no fallback and no hint to reinstall.",
